{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块能直接交代人物处境、原因和转折，单看大字也容易串起故事；X 的高亮词有时只留下“笃定没撑多久”“舍不得什么”这样的信息片段。small：X 的感受补充更有层次，也较少与话语重复；Y 有些小字只是把大字已经表达的温暖、孤单、疲惫换个说法再讲一遍。core：X 更清楚地呈现了维护尊严与怀念归属之间的反复拉扯，尤其结尾“不逼自己选边”“不再为了留住谁把那些委屈咽下去”，把最终选择落得更实；concise：X 整体同义叠加较少，Y 在 S01、S03、S08、S10 等处有较明显的感受重复。human：X 的表达总体更符合日常说话习惯；Y 的“四周冷空”“维护自己的劲”“像动摇后仍能决定怎样站立”搭配或语气生硬，“负隅顽抗”也偏书面。fine：X 的“越亲切，越能感到它离眼前有多远”“看得见，却回不去”等表达更有辨识度；Y 有些地方落到了“愤怒、遗憾、怀念”“绝望”“共同记忆和希望”等较笼统的情绪或概念。load：X 虽然高亮点较多，但每处文字短，实际需要扫读的信息量较小；Y 在 S10、S11、S12 等短停留屏幕上累积了多个较长的大块，阅读负担相对更高。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1684b130-15dc-467e-9a0b-f7a5f0920a2d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T030258861465Z", "elapsed_seconds": 227.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T03:06:46.310059+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "180e4b3217e923a74903d8c26c0c7512f458b5e266304c7c7d9dad7ee229eaaf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_b